{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to book, ask a question, or check accessibility for our sound gatherings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1724; --card:#0b1220a6; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --accent:#9be7ff; --muted:#b8cbd6; --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --glass-radius: 14px; --radius-sm:8px;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color-scheme: dark;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#061021 0%, #071426 60%);color:#e6f7fb}
    /* inline SVG background as decorative pattern (no external assets) */
    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.06}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px}
    header.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6de0d9);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(15,20,36,0.6);font-weight:700;color:#04202a}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:20px;margin-top:28px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter: blur(8px);border-radius:var(--glass-radius);padding:22px}
    .lead{font-size:20px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}
    .title{font-size:28px;margin:8px 0 4px}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    form.contact{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:inherit;font-size:14px}
    input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:#9eb5bf}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    button.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6de0d9);color:#012;border:none;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--muted);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}

    /* proof gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 240px;gap:18px}
    .testimony{min-height:140px;position:relative;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .quote{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .who{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    .dots{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);cursor:pointer}
    .dot.active{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(155,231,255,0.07);background:var(--accent)}

    .badges{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass-2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);position:relative}
    .badge .bicon{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#052430,#084052);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;background:#041216;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);top:-10px;left:110%;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px);transition:opacity .18s,transform .18s}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}

    /* pricing comparator microwidget */
    .compare{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px;border-radius:999px}
    .toggle button{background:transparent;border:none;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    .price{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* benefits & process */
    .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:20px}
    .benefit{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass-2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}

    /* faq */
    .faq{margin-top:18px}
    .q{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);margin-bottom:8px}

    footer{margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media(max-width:980px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .proof{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .container{padding:18px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="bg-svg" aria-hidden="true" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 1200 800" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#07202a" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#052234" />
      </linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p1" width="60" height="60" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(20)">
        <rect width="60" height="60" fill="url(#g1)"></rect>
        <path d="M0 30 L60 30 M30 0 L30 60" stroke="#063843" stroke-width="0.8"/>
        <circle cx="45" cy="15" r="2.2" fill="#0b6b72"/>
        <circle cx="15" cy="45" r="1.2" fill="#086e6f"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="1200" height="800" fill="url(#p1)" />
  </svg>

  <main class="container">
    <header class="nav" role="banner">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav role="navigation" aria-label="Main">
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Tariffs</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who we are</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="title">Reach a calm line — talk to us</div>
        <div class="lead">A short note is enough. Tell us if you need quiet arrivals, mobility access, or a tailored session. We reply within 48 hours.</div>

        <form class="contact" id="contactForm" aria-label="Contact form">
          <div class="row">
            <input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email — {{EMAIL}}" required />
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Phone — {{PHONE}}" />
            <select name="preferred">
              <option value="email">Prefer reply by email</option>
              <option value="phone">Prefer reply by phone</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us what you hope for (bookings, questions, accessibility)." required></textarea>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button type="submit" class="primary">Send request</button>
              <button type="button" class="ghost" id="callBtn">Call us</button>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">We can confirm by phone or email — whichever you choose.</div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">
          Contraindications: If you have epilepsy, implanted electronic devices, an untreated heart condition, are in early pregnancy, or are unusually sensitive to vibrations, please consult your medical provider before attending. If in doubt, contact us and we will advise on safe options and accommodations.
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card" aria-labelledby="contact-aside">
        <div id="contact-aside">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end">
            <div>
              <div class="small">Quick connect</div>
              <div style="font-weight:800;font-size:18px;margin-top:6px">{{PHONE}}</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">{{EMAIL}}</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="primary" style="padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03);margin:12px 0" />

          <div class="compare" aria-hidden="false">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <div class="small">Choose view</div>
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
                <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
                  <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
                  <button id="packBtn" role="tab" aria-selected="false">6-Session Pack</button>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="price" id="priceVal">—</div>
                  <div class="small" id="priceNote">per person</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Toggle to see a live comparison between a recurring monthly option and a bundled package. Numbers animate for clarity.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="proof">
      <div>
        <div class="testimony card" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="quote" id="quoteText">"Gentle room, clearer evening breath — I left lighter and stayed calmer for days."</div>
          <div class="who" id="quoteAuthor">— A. Rivera, attendee</div>

          <div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="cols" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="benefit">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Accessible openings</div>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">Short arrivals, clear signage, and space for sit/lie options so you can settle in without rush.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="benefit">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Quiet guidance</div>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">Brief spoken orientation to help ears and breath find the field we share together.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="badges">
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="bicon">✓</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Verified Facilitator</div>
            <div class="small">Professional accreditation and ongoing training</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tooltip">Trained in safe sound delivery and trauma-aware facilitation.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="badge">
          <div class="bicon">8+</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Years in practice</div>
            <div class="small">Hundreds of sessions locally</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tooltip">Consistent practice with local communities and private clients.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="badge">
          <div class="bicon">★</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Community Trusted</div>
            <div class="small">Positive feedback and repeat attendance</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tooltip">We prioritize safety, clarity of instructions, and respectful sound levels.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div style="font-weight:700">How contact turns into a meeting</div>
      <ol style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">
        <li><strong>Reply:</strong> We respond within 48 hours to confirm details or suggest times.</li>
        <li><strong>Plan:</strong> If it’s a private or group ask, we sketch a brief outline and accessibility notes.</li>
        <li><strong>Meet:</strong> Arrive 10 minutes early; we hold a calm check-in and a short grounding before sound begins.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="faq card" aria-label="Contact frequently asked questions">
      <div style="font-weight:700">Questions we often get</div>
      <div class="q"><strong>How long to get a reply?</strong><div class="small" style="margin-top:6px">Usually within 48 hours. If it’s urgent, call {{PHONE}}.</div></div>
      <div class="q"><strong>Can I come late?</strong><div class="small" style="margin-top:6px">Late arrivals can be disruptive; contact us if you anticipate delay and we’ll advise on the best arrival time.</div></div>
      <div class="q"><strong>Need help with accessibility?</strong><div class="small" style="margin-top:6px">Yes. Tell us in your message what support you need: seating, step-free access, or scent-free options.</div></div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">Ready to reserve?</div>
        <div class="small" style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">Choose a path: drop a note or book directly.</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px">
        <a href="book.html" class="primary">Reserve a place</a>
        <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="ghost">Email us</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="privacy.html" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">Privacy</a></div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Contact buttons
    document.getElementById('callBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      window.location.href = 'tel:{{PHONE}}';
    });

    // Testimonials (Proof Gallery)
    (function(){
      const items = [
        {text: 'The room felt safe and sparing. I left with a steadier chest and easy thought.', who: 'M. Chen'},
        {text: 'Brief guidance, rich sound. It fit my week and my sleep improved.', who: 'J. Lopez'},
        {text: 'A careful field for small repair — attentive and uncluttered.', who: 'R. Patel'},
        {text: 'I appreciated the clear arrival instructions and the gentle pacing.', who: 'S. Gomez'}
      ];
      let idx = 0; const quote = document.getElementById('quoteText'); const who = document.getElementById('quoteAuthor'); const dots = document.getElementById('dots');
      function renderDots(){
        dots.innerHTML = '';
        items.forEach((it,i)=>{
          const d = document.createElement('div'); d.className='dot'+(i===idx? ' active':''); d.dataset.i = i; d.setAttribute('role','button'); d.setAttribute('aria-label','Show testimonial '+(i+1));
          d.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ idx = i; show(); resetInterval(); });
          dots.appendChild(d);
        });
      }
      function show(){
        // fade animation
        quote.style.opacity = 0; who.style.opacity = 0;
        setTimeout(()=>{
          quote.textContent = '"'+items[idx].text+'"';
          who.textContent = '— '+items[idx].who;
          quote.style.opacity = 1; who.style.opacity = 1;
          renderDots();
        },220);
      }
      renderDots(); show();
      let t = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%items.length; show(); },4000);
      function resetInterval(){ clearInterval(t); t = setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1)%items.length; show(); },4000); }
    })();

    // Pricing Comparator (animated numbers)
    (function(){
      const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
      const packBtn = document.getElementById('packBtn');
      const priceVal = document.getElementById('priceVal');
      const priceNote = document.getElementById('priceNote');

      const plans = {
        monthly: {value: 28, note: 'per person / month'},
        pack: {value: 150, note: 'per person / 6-session pack'}
      };

      let current = 'monthly';
      function animateTo(target){
        const start = parseFloat(priceVal.dataset.num) || 0;
        const end = target;
        const startTime = performance.now();
        const dur = 450;
        function step(now){
          const t = Math.min(1, (now-startTime)/dur);
          const eased = t<.5? (2*t*t) : (-1 + (4-2*t)*t); // simple ease
          const val = Math.round((start + (end-start)*eased)*100)/100;
          priceVal.textContent = '$'+val.toLocaleString();
          priceVal.dataset.num = val;
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }

      function setActive(mode){
        monthlyBtn.classList.toggle('active', mode==='monthly');
        packBtn.classList.toggle('active', mode==='pack');
        monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', mode==='monthly');
        packBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', mode==='pack');
        priceNote.textContent = plans[mode].note;
        animateTo(plans[mode].value);
      }

      monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ if(current!=='monthly'){ current='monthly'; setActive(current); } });
      packBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ if(current!=='pack'){ current='pack'; setActive(current); } });

      // initialize
      priceVal.dataset.num = '0';
      setActive(current);
    })();

    // Fake submit handling
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const btn = this.querySelector('button.primary');
      btn.textContent = 'Sending...'; btn.disabled = true;
      setTimeout(()=>{ btn.textContent = 'Sent — we will reply soon'; },900);
      setTimeout(()=>{ btn.textContent = 'Send request'; btn.disabled = false; this.reset(); },3200);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page chunk for sound_bath site (chunk 4)

Files included:
- contact.html  -> Full contact page with inline styles and scripts

Notes & instructions:
- Placeholders to replace in templating/deployment:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

- Design approach: glass-morphism panel layout, minimal poetic voice, and small interactive widgets.
- Visual pattern: an inline SVG background at the top of contact.html (no external asset required).

Interactive features implemented locally (no external libs):
- Proof Gallery: Rotating testimonials with manual dot navigation and auto-cycle. The testimonials update with a small fade and ring indicator.
- Credibility Badges: Badges include subtle tooltip text that appears on hover.
- Pricing Comparator (micro): A toggle between "Monthly" and "6-Session Pack" with animated price transitions.

Accessibility & safety:
- Form fields include placeholders and required attributes.
- Contraindications disclaimer present and responsible guidance to consult medical providers when appropriate.

Integration tips:
- Ensure phone and email placeholders are replaced prior to publishing to enable direct dial/mailto links.
- The contact form uses a simulated submit flow for the static demo. Replace the submit handler with your backend endpoint or integrate with your preferred form service.
- Keep the inline SVG if you want the exact background; you may replace it or move to an external SVG if you add assets later.

Testing:
- Open contact.html in a browser. Test the testimonial rotation, hover badges, pricing toggle animation, and form submit simulation.
- Use keyboard navigation to verify focus states on buttons. The toggle buttons use aria-selected for basic assistive tech support.

Chunk: 4 of site build. This chunk only contains the contact page; other pages are expected in other chunks (index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, faq.html, book.html).

Author: Senior web designer + front-end engineer (generated template)
"} 
